            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The team focused on strategies for collaborating on business ventures in US real estate sector, with particular emphasis on distressed properties. They aimed to align business operations, marketing efforts, and service delivery for mutual benefit.",
